        {
          "text": "rivuga, rit’ Ic’ ubona ucandike mu gitabo, ukirungikire amashengero ndwi, ukirungike muri Efeso n’i Simuruna n’i Perugamo n’i Tuwatira n’i Sarudi n’i Filadelufiya n’i Lawodikiya.",
