        },
        {
          "text": "kandi hagati y’ivyo biterekwakw amatara mbona uwusa n’Umwana w’umuntu, yambaye imyambaro ishika ku birenge, yambaye mu gikiriza umukanda w’izahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
