        {
          "text": "Ndamubonye, nikubita imbere y’inyundo ziwe nk’ūpfuye; maz’ anshirak’ ukuboko kw’i buryo, ati Ntutinye; jewe nd’ uwa mbere kandi nd’ uw’ iherezo, ",
